5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that doesn't expose individual contributions. Visibility is the enemy here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Agreed. But before we pick a method, we must consider the administrative burden on the treasurer.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to understand the disparity in attendance before we discuss fees. Who is actually showing up?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The hesitation in the room is palpable. We need to address why people are pulling back.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to guess at costs. We need hard numbers on what we can actually count on.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, if we look at attendance, we risk making the unevenness public. That’s dangerous.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the danger is a treasurer quitting. I need to see the workload logs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Asuka, it’s already being muttered. Better to know the truth than speculate.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I’m concerned about the social friction. Let’s look at the quieter members’ feedback.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I’m looking at the bank statements. I need to know how many people are struggling to pay.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the taster forms. I need to know why newcomers don’t stay.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the outgoing treasurer’s hours. That will tell us the true cost of collection.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll tally the sign-in sheets. I need to see the distribution of attendance.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll look at the winter social feedback. I want to hear from the hesitant regulars.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I’ll also check the ledger. I need to see the fixed costs versus variable ones.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
